== New Features ==

* validation: the new `storage.revlog.validate-incoming-content` option checks
  the content of every incoming revision against its node id.
  (This only apply to incoming bundle, stream clone or some extensions may
  still prevent validation at unbundle time)

* validation: `storage.revlog.validate-delta-base` is refocused on validating
  the local content used during bundle ingestion, as initially intended. For
  historical reason, it still enables `storage.revlog.validate-incoming-content`
  unless that option is set explicitly.

